OL,3,GNEWSADetectorists strike gold despite
OL,4,Afaulty headset
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medieval gold ring unearthed by two
OL,7,Fmetal detectorists is expected to fetch
OL,8,Fmore than #10,000 at auction.
OL,10,FFriends Aaron Pizzey, 30, and James
OL,11,FRace, 39, made their discovery in a
OL,12,Fploughed field near Stoke Ash in
OL,13,FSuffolk, in April 2024.
OL,15,FEngineering lecturer Pizzey, who works
OL,16,Fat a college in west Suffolk, said he
OL,17,Fwas about to throw away a faulty
OL,18,Fheadset just before they struck lucky.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
